<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Leventis half-yr profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Leventis half-yr profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results of Nigerian conglomerate A. G. Leventis &amp; Co Plc to end-June.</p>
<p>					 (In million naira)</p>
<p>					 1996		1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    1,000    vs	807</p>
<p>Profit before tax	136    vs	 66</p>
<p>Tax				     44     vs	 21</p>
<p>Profit after tax	    92     vs	 45</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
</text>
